    "description": "The House of Publius Casca Longus (I, 6, 11) is located on the Via dell'Abbondanza and is also known as the Casa dei Quadretti Teatrali.",
    "details": "<p>The conventionalized name of the house derives from a tenuous connection made by the excavators to an inscribed marble tripod found in the garden of I, 6, 8-9.</p>",
